  "business_type_id": "wholesale",
  "kind": "goods",
  "_notes": [
    "Standalone type per explicit decision, not a variant/attribute of",
    "other types. Deliberately broad — a real wholesale business usually",
    "specializes in ONE of these category groups (foodstuffs, beverages,",
    "household, building materials, produce) rather than all of them; this",
    "template covers the common groupings rather than assuming a single",
    "specialization. Bulk unit sizes (sack_50kg, tonne, crate/case rather",
    "than single-piece) are the main structural difference from the",
    "retail-facing templates for the same goods.",
    "Growth-path note: kiosk -> retailer -> wholesaler is a possible",
    "future maturity path (not implemented) — this template stands alone",
    "regardless of how a business arrived at being a wholesaler."
  ],
